1438
01:14:42,333 --> 01:14:43,416
<i>Aku tidak berpikir.</i>

1439
01:14:44,375 --> 01:14:46,291
Beri aku ide, Bung Vinoth.

1440
01:14:46,375 --> 01:14:47,250
